# /design — Prototype

Skill: `.cursor/skills/design/SKILL.md`

- Build with shadcn-ui + existing `components/ui`, `molecules`, `organisms`.
- Real UI, real actions, real frontend logic.
- Mock only at the API response boundary; do not make disconnected page-only fake flows.
- Source requirement: `docs/features/{slug}/spec.yaml`
- **Không** call real backend API; `/wire` replaces the mocked API boundary with real services.
- Nếu mock đã mô phỏng API thì reuse contract như API thật: detail API dùng cho detail/edit/duplicate; block/tab entity độc lập thì tách API riêng theo block, không gom vào 1 payload lớn.
- Gắn `data-testid` sớm (`docs/E2E-TESTIDS.md`)
- Verify: `npm run dev`, `npx nuxi typecheck`
